<title>USA: Mako Marine names Reyenger president.</title>
<headline>Mako Marine names Reyenger president.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Richard Reyenger has been elected president of Mako Marine International Inc, the company said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Former president Doug Baena, who took the company public several years ago, has left to pursue other interests but will remain on the board.</p>
<p>Reyeneger was vice president of sales for Outboard Marine Corp's Boat Group.</p>
